Subject: [PATCH 1/9] wip(post): grblHAL post script and its decisions (#710)

Not registered or tested yet. Still to do on this branch:
- register in BUILTINS (crates/app/src/posting.rs), cam.d.ts and script/mod.rs post lists
- goldens: WRITE_GOLDEN=1 cargo test -p camcraft-app --test conformance
  (tap_plate goes into REFUSED with reason "tapping"; EXTENSIONS gets grblhal/nc)
- add grblhal to the cross-post tests: comment_escape, control_comp, wear_comp,
  post/tests/comp.rs, fanuc_post (non_rtcp), inverted_post, program_comments,
  after_op + coolant + coolant_followups (MILLS; home refusal like Heidenhain)
- grblhal_post.rs (header, T M6 alone, no G43/G49, dwell seconds, tap refused,
  safe Z refused when unstated) and a generic grblhal-3axis.mch (MACHINES, machine.rs)
- note: upstream main's lathe_thread_travel test does not build (missing field
  'hand'); run test targets with --test, not the whole crate

